<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1 John</book>
  <para style="h">1 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 John</para>
  <para style="mt">1 John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kipat cila na omsa, ka na zahsa uh, ka mit vua ka na musa uh, ka na etciensa ule ka na thamsa uh hinna thu tawh kisai-in note kungah kang gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami hinna pen ang kilang zo ta a, kote in mu-in tua thu teci a pang ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note zong kote tawh na kipawlton thei nadingun ka musa ule ka zahsa uh thute no tungah kang tangko hi; a tahtahin kote zong Pa le a Tapa tawh kipawltonin ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote’ lungdamna a bukim thei nadingin tami thute ang giel ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote in ama tung panin ka zah zaw ciengun note tunga kang tangko uh thu in, Pasien pen khuovah ahi a, ama sungah khuomiel a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama tawh kipawlton ka hi hi, ci napi khuomiel sungah i gamtat leh zuouthu gen i hi a, thuman a zui lo i hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuovah sungah ama ma a op ma bangin eite zong khuovah sungah kalsuonin khatlekhat i kipawlton leh a Tapa Jesu’ sisan in i mawna zosie ei silsieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mawna ka nei sih hi, i ci leh eima le eima a kisol i hi a, i sungah thuman thutah a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I mawnate uh pulah leih a muonhuoi le a thutang ama in i mawnate ei maisahin i dihlonate zosie ei silsieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite in mawna ka bawl sih hi, i ci leh ama zuou gen i suohsah a, i sungah ama’ thu a om lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tanote aw, na maw khah lo nadingun tam thute ang giel ka hi hi. Hizongle mi khatpo in mawna a bawl leh eite in Pa tawh a omton hupa Jesu Khris i nei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama pen eite ading beh hi tham loin leitung mi zosie’ mawsut nading biehpiehna zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in ama’ thupiehte i zui leh ama thei i hi lam uh i kitheicien uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi khatpo in, “Ama ka thei zo hi,” a ci vangin ama’ thupiehte a zui tuon sih leh zuouthu gen mi ahi a, tua pa sungah thuman thutah a om sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hinanle ama’ thu a zui mi khatpo sungah Pasien’ itna a bukimin a tung tahtah zo hi. Tami thu ziehin eite in ama sunga i op lam i theicien uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ama sungah ka teng hi,” a ci poma in Jesu Khris gamtat banga a gamtat ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka itte aw, tu-a kang giel pen thupieh tha ahi sih a, a kipat cil pana na neisa uh thupieh lui pen ma ahi bo hi; tua thupieh lui pen na zahsa uh thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in ama tung le note tungah thupiehna tha a maan ang giel ka hi hi. Azieh pen khuomiel vengin khuovah tahtah ang tang zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Khuovah sungah ka om hi,” ci napi a sanggampa a muda poma khuomiel sunga omlai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sanggampa a it poma khuovah sunga teng ahi a, tua bang mi sungah pua nading a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle thu um mi adang khat a muda poma khuomiel sungah omin khuomiel sunga lam pei ahi a, khuomiel in ama mittawsah ahi ziehin a pei nading lampi a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanote aw, ama’ min hang tawh na mawnate uh kimaisah zo ahi ziehin, note lai kang hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pate aw, a cil a kipanin a om pa, na thei ziehun note lai kang hlah hi. Khangnote aw, gilopa na zaw ziehun note lai kang hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tanote aw, Pa na thei ziehun note lai kang hlah hi. Pate aw, a cila a om pa na thei ziehun note lai kang hlah hi. Khangnote aw, na tha uh hat a, na sung vuah Pasien’ thu tengin, gilopa zozo na hi ziehun note lai kang hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitung le leitunga om nate it sih un. Leitung a it mite sungah Pa itna om lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />azieh pen leitunga om sil bangkim, cilesa lunggulna, mittang’ deigawna, hauna zieha kisahtheina, cite pen Pasien kung pana ang pei ahi sih a, leitung pana ang pei hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung le a deigawna mangthai thei a, hinanle Pasien’ deina banga gamtate kumtawnin a kip den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tate aw, tuhun pen hun nukhia ahi ta hi! Khris langpang ahi antikhris ang pieng ding hi, ci thu na zahsa uh ahi ma bangin, tu-in antikhris tampitah ang pieng zo hi. Tami panin eite in hun nukhia ahi lam i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate pen ei kung pana a peikhie ahi uhi, ahi vangin amate ei pawl ahi sih uhi; ei pawl hi uleh ei tawh ang omton peisuoh ding uhi. Ahi vangin a peikhietna panun amate khat mama zong ei pawl ahi lo lam ei theiciensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Siengtho Pa in note sathau ang nu zo ta a, tuaci’n note zosie in theina na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuman thutah na thei lo zieh uh hi loin, na thei zieh ma ule tua thuman thutah panin zuouthu a pien lo lam na thei zieh vua ang giel ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu pen Khris ahi hi, ci-a a nielte simlo zuou thugen i cite koi ahei? Pa le Tapa a niel mite pen antikhris ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tapa a niel koima in Pa a nei sih a, Tapa a sang mi zosie in Pa a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note in a cil a kipanin na zahsa uh thute na sung vuah tengsah un. Note in a cil a kipanin na zahsa uh thute na sung vua a ten leh Pa le Tapa sungah zong na teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale tam pen ama in eite ei ciemsa tawntung hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note ang sol mite tawh kisai-in na kung vuah tam thu teng ang giel ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Note na hi uleh na sung vuah ama tung pana na nga uh sathau nuna a op den ziehin ang hil ding mi koima na kisam sih uhi. Ahi vangin tua sathau nuna in note thu zosie ang hil bangin tua ang hil thute thuman ahi a, tua pen zuouthu ahi lo ziehin ang hil bang lienin ama sungah teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tanote aw, ama ang kilah ciengin eite in kimuonna nei-in ama ang pei ciengin ama mai-ah i maizum lo nadingin tu-in ama sungah teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Note in ama dih hi, ci-a na thei uleh sil dih bawl zosie ama’ piensah ahi hi, ci na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ tate ei kici thei nadingin bangza tahin Pa in ei it ahei ci thei un; eite zong lah tua ma i hi pai uhi. Leitung in eite ei thei lona a hang pen ama a thei lo zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka itte aw, tu-in Pasien’ tate i hi ta uhi; mai lamah bang hi lai ding i hei, ci ei kilah nai lo hi. Eite’ thei thu pen tami ahi hi: Ama ang kilah ciengin ama tawh i kibang ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile eite in ama ahi bangin i mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama sungah tami lametna a nei zosie in ama’ sientho bang lienin amau le amau zong siengtho uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mawna a bawl poma thukham palsat ahi hi; mawna pen thukham palsatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawna lakhie dingin ama ang kilang hi, ci thu le ama sungah mawna om lo hi, ci thu na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama sunga a teng koima in mawna a bawl sih hi; mawna a bawl mi koima in ama a mu lo le a thei lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tanote aw, koima in kisolsah sih un. Ama a dih bang lienin a diha gamta mi poma midih ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mawna a bawl poma dawimangpa’ ta ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile a kipatcil a kipan dawimangpa pen mawna bawl ahi hi. Dawimangpa’ nasepte a susie dingin Pasien’ Tapa ang kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien’ piensah mite in mawna a bawl sih uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate sungah Pasien’ khaici a teng hi; Pasien’ piensah mite ahi ziehun amate in mawna a bawl thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam bang danin Pasien’ tate le dawimangpa’ tate a kilang hi: A dihin gamta loin a sanggamte a it lo zosie pen Pasien kung pana ang pei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note in a kipat cila kipanin na zahsa uh thu ahile khatlekhat i ki-it nading thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gilopa kung pana ang pei a naupa a that Cain i bang sih ding uhi. Tuale bang dinga a sanggam pa a tha ahiei? Azieh pen ama gamtat sie-in a sanggampa a gamtat a dih zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, leitung in ang muda leh lamdang sa sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite khatlekhat i ki-it ziehin sina kantanin hinna ah i galkai zo ta hi, ci thu i thei hi. Itna a nei lo poma pen sina sunga a omlai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sanggam muda zosiete mi that ahi a, mi thatte in tawntung hinna a nei lo lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in eite adingin a hinna ei pieh ziehin tuami tawh itna thu i thei uhi. Eite zong khatlekhat i hinna uh i kipieh ding a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung’ haunate nei-in a sanggam khat’ kisapna mu giagua napi a hu nuom lo mi khatpo sungah bangci bangin Pasien’ itna om thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tanote aw, thu le kam beh tawh ki-it loin, thutah sungah sepna tawh ki-it vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale tami thu ziehin eite pen thutah pana pieng i hi vua, i lungtang in eite ei mawsah sielin ama mai-ah i lung a nuomsahkia dingte i hi lam i thei ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile i lungtang sangin Pasien lienzaw a, ama in sil bangkim a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka itte aw, i lungtang in ei mawsah sih leh Pasien mai-ah eite in hanna i nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eite in ama’ thupiehte zui-in ama lungkim nading i gamtat ziehin ama tung panin i nget popo i nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama’ thupiehna tami ahi hi. Ama’ tapa Jesu Khris’ min i up ding le ama’ ei sawlna bang lienin khatlekhat i ki it ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama’ thupiehte a zui zosie ama sungah teng a, ama zong tua mite sungah a teng hi. Tuale eite sungah ama a ten lam pen ama’ ei pieh Hlagau tawh i theithei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka itte aw, hlagau popo um pai sih unlen, Pasien tung pana ang pei amah ci-in sittel bo un. Bangzieh ahei cile leitungah kamsang zuou tampi tah pei zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam thu tawh Pasien’ Hlagau na thei ding uhi: Jesu Khris tahsa sungah ang pei zo hi, ci-a a sang poma Pasien tung pan hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu a sang lo hlagau poma Pasien tung pan ahi sih hi. Tam pen ang pei ding hi ci-a na zahsa uh antikhris’ hlagau hi a, tu-in leitungah a om zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tanote aw, note pen Pasien pan na hi vua, amate na zozo uhi. Azieh pen leitunga a om pa sangin note sunga a om pa lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate pen leitung pan ahi uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate in leitung thu genin leitung in a thugen uh a ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite i hi leh Pasien pan i hi uhi. Pasien a thei poma in i thu gen a ngai vua, Pasien pan ahi lo poma in i thu gen a ngai sih uhi. Tam panin eite in hlagau man le hlagau zuou i theithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka itte aw, khatlekhat na ki-it un; bangzieh ahei cile itna pen Pasien pana ang pei ahi hi; mi a it thei zosie Pasien’ piensah hi a, tuaci’n Pasien a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna a nei lo poma in Pasien a thei sih hi, bangzieh ahei cile Pasien pen itna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite lahah Pasien’ itna tam bangin ang kilang hi: Ama tungtawnin eite i hin thei nadingin Pasien in leitungah a Tapa neisun ang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna i ci tami ahi hi. Eite pen Pasien it i hi sih vua, ama in eite ei itin i mawnate zieha thoidam biehpiehna dingin a tapa ang sawl hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka itte aw, Pasien in taza tahin eite ei it ahile eite zong khatlekhat i ki-it ding uh a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koima in Pasien mu ngai lo hi; eite khatlekhat i ki-it leh eite sungah Pasien teng a, tuaci’n ama’ itna in eite sungah a bukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in ama’ Hlagau ei pie zo ahi ziehin ama sungah eite i om a, eite sungah zong ama a op lam tami thu tawh i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pa in leitung’ Hunpa dingin a Tapa ang sawlna thu eite in mu-in teci i pang zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu pen Pasien’ Tapa ahi hi, ci-a a sang mite sungah Pasien teng a, amate zong Pasien sungah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in eite ei itna thu, eite in thei-in i um zo ta uhi. Pasien pen itna ahi hi, itna sunga a tengte pen Pasien sunga teng ahi a, Pasien zong amate sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thukhen ni ciengin eite in hansanna i nei thei nadingin eite lahah tam bangin itna ang kicingsah hi, azieh pen ama bangin eite zong leitunga pieng i hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Itna sungah zauna om lo a, ahi vangin itna bukim in zauna a paimang hi; bangzieh ahei cile zauna pen dan thuoh ding ginna ahi a, tuaci’n a zau poma itna sungah a cingtah nai lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in eite ei it masah ziehin eite in ama i it uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pasien ka it hi,” ci napi a sanggamte a mudate pen zuou gente ahi uhi; azieh pen a mu thei a sanggam pa a it lote in a mu thei lo Pasien a it thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eite in ama tung panin tami thupieh i nei uhi: Pasien a itte in a sanggamte zong a it uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in Khris ahi hi, ci-a a um poma Pasien’ piensah mi hi a, nulepa a it poma in zong a ta a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien itin ama’ thupiehte i zui ciengin eite in tami tawh Pasien’ tate i it lam i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien i itna i ci in ama’ thupiehte i zuina ahi hi. Ama ei thupiehte zong a zuiha ahi seng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ piensah mi poma in leitung a zo hi. Leitung a zo guolzawna i ci pen eite’ upna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu in Pasien’ Tapa hi, ci-a a um mi simlo leitung a zo koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tui le sisan tawh ang pei pa in Jesu Khris ahi a, tui beh tawh hi loin, tui le sisan tawh ang pei hi. Tua teci pang pa pen Hlagau ahi hi, azieh pen tua Hlagau pen thuman thutah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Teci pang thum a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua teng pen Hlagau, tui le sisan ahi a, tami thum teng a kithutuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite in mihing teci panna sang thei i hi leh Pasien’ teci panna pen a lienzaw ahi hi. Azieh pen Pasien in tu-a bangin a Tapa’ thu teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ tapa a umte in a lungsim sung vuah teci panna a nei uhi. Pasien a um lote in Pasien in a tapa tungtang teci a panna um lo uh ahi ziehin ama zuougen a suohsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale tami pen teci panna ahi hi: Pasien in eite kumtawn hinna ei pie a, a Tapa sungah tami hinna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tapa a nei poma in hinna a nei hi; Pasien’ tapa a nei lo poma in hinna a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien tapa’ min a um note in kumtawn hinna na nei lam uh na thei nadingun note tungah tami thute kang giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama sunga i nei uh lungmuonna pen tami ahi a, eite in ama’ deina tawh kituohin na khatpo i nget nah leh ama in ei za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I nget khat popo ei za hi, ci i thei leh ama kunga i nget popo i nga zo hi, ci i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sanggampa in sina dong ding ahi lo mawna a bawl na mu leh thu na nget pieh ding a, Pasien in sina dong ding ahi lo mawna bawlte tungah hinna a pie ding hi. Sina dong a tun mawna a om hi; tuate adingin thu nget pieh in a ci ka hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gamtat khielna zosie mawna hi a, hinanle sina a tun lo mawna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasien’ piensah mite in mawna a bawl sih hi, ci thu eite in i thei a, Pasien’ piensah mipa in amate kemcing ahi ziehin gilo pa in amate a thamkha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien’ tate i hi lam le gilopa’ uhna sungah leitung mi zosie a op lam eite in i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite in ama a thuman ahi lam i thei nadingin Pasien’ Tapa hing pei zo a ci le theitheina ei pie zo ci zong i thei hi; eite i hi uleh tua a thuman a Tapa Jesu Khris sungah i om uhi. Ama pen a thuman Pasien le tawntung hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tanote aw, milimte panin no le no na kikem un.
  </para>
</usx>
